@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor #FEFEFE
skinparam defaultTextAlignment center
skinparam participant {
  BorderColor #2C3E50
  BackgroundColor #ECF0F1
  FontColor #2C3E50
  FontSize 12
}
skinparam database {
  BorderColor #8E44AD
  BackgroundColor #E8DAEF
  FontColor #8E44AD
  FontSize 12
}
skinparam actor {
  BorderColor #E67E22
  BackgroundColor #F0B27A
  FontColor #E67E22
  FontSize 12
}

title "sd-05 — 5-Day Auto-Cancel (Hangfire Scheduled Job)"

participant "Hangfire\nScheduler" as HF
participant ".NET API\n(MonsterASP)" as API
database "MS SQL\nServer" as DB
actor "System" as SYS
actor "SMTP\n(Gmail)" as SMTP

== Daily at 03:00 ==

HF -> API: Trigger AutoCancelOrphansJob
activate API

API -> DB: SELECT o.id, oi.variant_id, oi.qty,\nou.parent_email\nFROM orders o\nJOIN order_items oi ON oi.order_id = o.id\nWHERE o.state IN\n('placed', 'ready_to_ship',\n 'ready_for_pickup')\nAND o.state_changed_at < DATEADD(DAY, -5, NOW())
activate DB
DB --> API: [ { orderId, items, parentEmail } ]  10 rows
deactivate DB

loop for each stalled order
  API -> DB: BEGIN TRANSACTION
  activate DB

  API -> DB: UPDATE orders\nSET state = 'cancelled',\ncancelled_at = NOW()\nWHERE id = orderId

  loop for each item
    API -> DB: UPDATE variant\nSET stock = stock + qty\nWHERE id = variant_id
    note right: Stock restored for\neach item
  end

  API -> DB: INSERT audit_log\n(action='order.auto_cancelled',\nactor='system', order_id=orderId)

  API -> DB: COMMIT
  deactivate DB

  API -> SMTP: Send auto-cancel\nnotification email
end

note right: Idempotent — subsequent runs\nskip already-cancelled orders.

API --> HF: { cancelledCount: 10 }
deactivate API

@enduml
